// Stage 3 check: Posted MTD by day for July 2025 and November 2026, all accounts and entities. Synthetic GBP.
// November 2026 has no accounting period of its own: it holds only late adjustments for October 2026, converted at the October rate.
// Compared with an independent pandas recomputation by tools/verify_measures.py.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Date'[Date],
    TREATAS ( { 202507, 202611 }, 'Date'[Year Month Key] ),
    "Posted MTD", [Posted MTD]
)
ORDER BY 'Date'[Date]
